📈 Key Business Insights

Revenue: Over 7M total revenue with 97% YoY growth.

Customer Retention: 3.3% repeat customers, highlighting opportunities for loyalty programs.

Operational Performance:

96.2% successful deliveries.

99.2% on-time or early deliveries.

Distance & Freight Efficiency:

Average delivery distance: 576 km.

Freight ratio: 16.9% of order value.

Customer Segmentation:

Top 25% customers drive 62% of total revenue.

Customer Sentiment:

78% positive reviews, average rating 4.1 / 5.

💡 Business Impact

This dashboard allows stakeholders to:

Optimize freight cost and logistics.

Identify and retain high-value customers.

Improve delivery efficiency and regional operations.

Monitor product-level performance.

Enhance customer satisfaction using review insights.

🧭 How to Use

Open the .pbix file in Power BI Desktop.

Connect to the MySQL database or refresh using CSV datasets.

Use slicers to filter by Year, Region, Customer Segment, and Delivery Status.

Navigate through report pages for detailed insights.

